# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`. .dev.vars is gitignored.
# Do not put real secrets in this example.
#
# FCM stays a dry run until this is set with `wrangler secret put` and
# DRY_RUN_PUSH is changed to "false".
# FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=
#
# Flora care fallback. Register at https://floraapi.com/register
# Set the real value in .dev.vars, and on the Worker with `wrangler secret put`.
# FLORA_API_KEY=
